+# fire: the four standard pipes tier up to wide (Cmd_Set_Pipe_Tier — the
+# story's modernize command, a LOGGED command so the tier flips replay-
+# deterministically from the blessed log) at 30000ms -> apply tick 601. The
+# era-3 demand then flows through the MODERN pipes at full rate (40 u/s):
+# no legacy state, no decay, no shed. The T1 contrast with legacy_decay.dem
+# (same ticks, same demand, only the legacy state differs) is the story's
+# measurability golden; the 60000ms capture shows the era-3 traffic sailing
+# through the modernized backbone.
+seed 20261
+run 70000ms
+era 2
+fixture qos
+advance gate on
+at 0ms draw 0 1 standard
+at 0ms draw 1 2 standard
+at 0ms draw 3 1 standard
+at 0ms draw 4 1 standard
